common.JustifyTextView.android:text:
Burbank Australia Pty Ltd is committed to ensuring your privacy is protected in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 and the Australian Privacy Principles. This is Burbank Australia Pty Ltd's Privacy Policy and it is to inform you of the following:

 • The process in which Burbank Australia Pty Ltd collects and holds your personal information;

 • The kind of personal information Burbank Australia Pty Ltd collects and holds about you;

 • The purpose for which Burbank Australia Pty Ltd collects, holds, uses and discloses your personal information;

 • How you can access, correct or update any personal information Burbank Australia Pty Ltd holds about you;

 • How you may complain about a breach of the Australian Privacy Principles and how Burbank Australia Pty Ltd will deal with such complaint; and

 • The potential disclosure of your personal information to an overseas recipient.

We, our agents, contractors, sub-contractors, external contractors (including but not limited to "Campaign Monitor Pty Ltd" and "National Pacific Finance Pty Ltd") and any member of our related entities, may use any of the information we have about you which we have collected for the purposes of providing you with our or our related entities services; to send you information about us or our related entities, publications and events; to improve our services and communications to you; for the purposes of employment or the retention of services; to send you invoices or reminder notices; to monitor online activity on Burbank websites and/or applications; to market, improve and ad to Burbank’s products and services (including online); and to process any request f or information from you or any applications submitted by you to us.
We may disclose your personal information in any of the following events:

If you have provided us with your personal information for the purposes of engaging us for our services then we may disclose your personal information to any of our employees, agents, contractors, sub-contractors and to any members of our related entities;
•	We may disclose your personal information to any of our agents, consultants and sub-contractors, including IT service providers, to assist us in the operation of our business including updating any of our websites, or to provide any business related services to us, and who are subject to strict security and confidentiality obligations;
•	we may disclose your personal information between our related entities on a confidential basis for the purposes of internal administration, billing and other business practices; and
•	we will disclose your personal information to the extent that the law requires us to disclose.
